minor type="added" "Audio session interruptions and media services resets reported by the audio engine (iOS, tvOS, visionOS): AudioManager.onAudioSessionEvent delivers AudioSessionEvent (interruptionBegan, interruptionEnded, mediaServicesWereReset), AudioManager.isAudioSessionInterrupted reports the interruption state, and AudioEngineObserver gains audioSessionDidBeginInterruption(reason:), audioSessionDidEndInterruption(shouldResume:) and audioSessionMediaServicesWereReset(), with default implementations that forward to the next observer"
